OL,3,GNEWSAHow student midwife became a
OL,4,AEuropean champion
OL,5,
OL,6,FGetting to the top in any sport
OL,7,Finvolves not only talent but also huge
OL,8,Fdedication and personal sacrifice.
OL,10,FSomething the aptly named Success Eduan
OL,11,Fknows all about.
OL,13,FAfter reaching the individual 200m
OL,14,Ffinal at the recent European
OL,15,FChampionships in Birmingham, the
OL,16,F21-year-old athlete from Manchester won
OL,17,Fgold in the women's 4x100m relay.
OL,19,FUnknown to many, though, Eduan combined
OL,20,Fher gruelling training regime with
OL,21,Fcompleting a three-year degree in
OL,22,Fmidwifery.
OL,23,APub: 29-AugQppppppppppppppppppppppppppp
